.TH push 1  "push " 
.SH NAME
push \- Publish the current clean workspace revision using named\-reference CAS
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpush\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREMOTE\fR> <\fIREFERENCE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Publish the current clean workspace revision using named\-reference CAS
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH COLLABORATION
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output structured machine JSON envelope
.TP
<\fIREMOTE\fR>
Configured remote name
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
Remote named reference to update (for example, main)
